WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.957 line:91%
Chapter 7. The tabs at the top of Lessons: Vocabulary, Printables, and Share.

00:00:07.366 --> 00:00:11.975 line:91%
Lessons has four tabs at the top. Open "Vocabulary".

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:19.716 line:91%
Each topic of the Picture Dictionary is a quick picture game. Every word has a picture.

00:00:20.175 --> 00:00:33.216 line:91%
Don't like a picture? Tap "Pictures", then tap a picture and choose another one: from your photos, the photo library, a free photo from the internet, or a new picture drawn by a free AI.

00:00:33.681 --> 00:00:39.296 line:91%
Now press "Send to learn". Students get the words on their phones, to learn at home.

00:00:39.758 --> 00:00:50.895 line:91%
The app makes three lists. Starters get the 8 easiest words, Explorers get 12, and Champions get all the words, plus challenge words. Tap a word to move it.

00:00:51.355 --> 00:00:57.455 line:91%
Press "Send". Every phone gets the list of its level. Absent students get it next time.

00:00:57.912 --> 00:01:09.195 line:91%
On the phone, the student taps the new words: pictures, sound, cards and a quiz. "Save for home" keeps them for home, with no Wi-Fi. Chapter 16 shows it.

00:01:09.654 --> 00:01:19.836 line:91%
To go up a level, students need 80%: in your class game, or in the level test on the phone. The card shows how many students are at each level.

00:01:21.003 --> 00:01:34.696 line:91%
Now the "Printables" tab: paper materials. A worksheet with an answer key, Test A and Test B, picture worksheets, bingo cards, a crossword, a word search, flashcards, certificates and a class list.

00:01:35.156 --> 00:01:43.457 line:91%
Choose where the words come from, colour or black and white, and press "Print". Every page shows your school, your name and the class.

00:01:43.919 --> 00:01:49.276 line:91%
Certificates: choose who gets one, the design, the certificate and the reason.

00:01:54.430 --> 00:02:02.177 line:91%
Add your signature once: type your name and tap a handwriting style. You can also draw it, or upload a photo of it.

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:11.956 line:91%
Press "Print" for paper, or "Send to phones". Each student gets only their own certificate, with confetti!

00:02:12.409 --> 00:02:23.397 line:91%
Last tab: "Share". Tick your lessons, activities, writing tasks or lesson plans, and make one file to send to a colleague. Nothing about your students is shared.

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:29.637 line:91%
A colleague sent you a file? Open it here, and choose what to add to your app.
